- [S2] STC20 failed: Every non-end node must have a path to at least one end node. | Violations: b9, n11, n23, n24, n27, n28, n29 | DSL: branch(b9,XOR); action(n11,"Return invoice"); action(n23,"Resolve non-compliance"); action(n24,"Notify client of payment"); action(n27,"Is client satisfied"); action(n28,"Resolve payment discrepancy"); action(n29,"Continue process")